Bonsai CUDA support for TensorFold v0.6.5.

Adds a CUDA entry point for prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-mlx-2bit and teaches the
Qwen3.8 CUDA loader to read Prism's 2-bit group-128 Hadamard pack. The changes are
active only for model_type prism_hadamard_qwen35: recurrent gates stay as floating
weights, packed projections rotate activations before MLX affine matmul, and the
embedding applies the inverse transform after dequantization. This favors correctness
and uses TensorFold's existing generic affine CUDA kernels for the 2-bit path.

